# ORPTA (Cursor)

Plans are implementation contracts for a weaker implementer with no access to this conversation. Full methodology: [ORPTA.md](https://github.com/rjchicago/ORPTA/blob/main/ORPTA.md)

## Cursor bindings

- **Plans:** `.cursor/plans/*.plan.md`
- **Frontmatter:** add `isProject` (boolean) alongside canonical ORPTA fields
- **Read-only planning:** use Plan mode before writing or refining plans
- **Research delegation:** `Task` with `subagent_type: explore` and `model: composer-2.5`; issue multiple `Task` calls in one message for parallel fan-out
- **Todo tracking:** `TodoWrite`
